    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aVirtual MoeMate\u300b&quot;is a desktop pet game for computers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your exclusive companion, lighting up the stars of every moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606930/extras/fb7ebaf56277ee88b521e2f49e316c98.avif?t=1755671845\" width=781 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click and drag Lily's position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space key switches between dual screen positions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support head following mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab key to bring up the side toolbar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute Lily Orange with 5 different hairstyles and hair colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: In 2D mode, the function of following the mouse is not included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606930/extras/b04194d1773c4d6afd6ae31db4b2f2f4.avif?t=1755671845\" width=781 height=352 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aVirtual MoeMate\u300b&quot;is a desktop pet game for computers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your exclusive companion, lighting up the stars of every moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606930/extras/fb7ebaf56277ee88b521e2f49e316c98.avif?t=1755671845\" width=781 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click and drag Lily's position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space key switches between dual screen positions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support head following mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tab key to bring up the side toolbar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute Lily Orange with 5 different hairstyles and hair colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: In 2D mode, the function of following the mouse is not included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606930/extras/b04194d1773c4d6afd6ae31db4b2f2f4.avif?t=1755671845\" width=781 height=352 /></span></p>",
